WEBVTT

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:06.680
Roar, Hurricane! Split the sky, Lightning!

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.950
Shuang Tou Long!

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:23.530
Developed in China and based on technology provided by GGG...

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.400
FuRyu and RaiRyu...

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.440
Now at last, they have succeeded in performing Symmetrical Docking...

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.980
...and have newly joined the ranks of true heroes.

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:34.510
And this robot's name is GekiRyuJin!

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.810
Our top priority is the preservation of human life.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.710
That's what you wished for, right, ChoRyuJin?

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:47.220
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:50.120
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:56.910
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:01.740
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:07.970
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:12.060
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:16.760
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.720
It's time to launch!

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:23.900
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:27.820
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.520
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:35.480
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:38.400
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:41.150
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:44.660
Pulverizing steel!

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:48.330
Goldion Hammer!

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:55.860
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:01.860
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:01.860 --> 00:02:04.680
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:08.860
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:12.780
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:15.850
The Arrival of Cain

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:18.450
<i>The Arrival of Cain</i>

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.550
It's time to say goodbye, right, Mamoru?

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.290
Thanks, Mic!

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:34.360
Mom!

00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:35.800
My little Mamoru!

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.510
Welcome home!

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:41.930
We were so worried about you!

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:47.500
Mamoru!

00:02:48.150 --> 00:02:49.280
Isamu!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:55.450
Waha!

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.750
System Change!

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:06.730
HyoRyu!

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:07.830
EnRyu!

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.600
Zhou-ji Jao-feng!

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:19.010
FuRyu!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:19.980
RaiRyu!

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:26.180
FuRyu, RaiRyu, HyoRyu, EnRyu, System Change complete.

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:29.520
Energy sync rate, 85%!

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:33.420
Right. We're going to begin the training program for Project 5 now.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.530
You are to capture the target and destroy it...

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.590
...advancing all the way to the final point.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:41.570
Note that we will be using live ammunition throughout this exercise.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:42.600
That's all.

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:43.600
Roger!

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.370
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:55.710
64, 65, 66...

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.050
Rei!

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.850
Feng Dao Dan!

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:09.860
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.290
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.900
HyoRyu, EnRyu! You're putting up a pretty good fight!

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:22.570
Heh! So are you, FuRyu and RaiRyu!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.480
They make an amazing combination.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:28.640
Hm?

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:30.080
Dr. Shishioh...

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.890
This is something I realized during the last battle.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.980
As their A.I. System matures, those two keep getting stronger and stronger.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:40.790
Even if the results prove to be counterproductive...

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.960
Is that our next target?

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.730
It's freakin' huge!

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.140
Let's go, EnRyu!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:52.340
Right!

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.690
No good. At this position, we'll just get picked off.

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.120
Pardon me!

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.880
You're not getting the jump on us!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:22.690
Ow!

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.290
What do you think you're doing, you moron?

00:05:29.780 --> 00:05:31.440
Heh! You've got to be kidding me!

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:42.790
That's what happens when you get carried away.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:44.590
Try to act like an adult.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.490
But it's not my fault!
But it's not my fault!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.820
Symmetrical Docking!

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:18.320
ChoRyuJin!

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:20.690
We can do it too, right?

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.060
Sure we can!

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.330
Symmetrical Docking!

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:49.880
GekiRyuJin!

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:54.820
Roar, Hurricane! Split the sky, Lightning!

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:56.890
Shuang Tou Long!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.200
Double Gun!

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.770
Feng Dao Dan!

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:16.570
Two separate souls, complementing each other and becoming one.

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:19.480
That is when Symmetrical Docking is achieved.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:24.150
What those two needed was not a pre-calculated program...

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:27.090
...but a unified soul.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:32.160
You're absolutely right.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:48.380
ChoRyuJin...

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:50.510
GekiRyuJin...

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:56.660
We've just received an order from the United Nations.

00:07:57.390 --> 00:07:58.920
FuRyu, RaiRyu...

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.630
As of today, you're being transferred to GGG.

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:04.490
We're joining GGG?

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.530
But what about our national defense duties?

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:09.030
Don't you understand?

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:12.900
Protecting the planet means that you'll also be protecting your homeland.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:15.940
Let's fight together.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:18.640
I think we have a good chance of getting along with you two!

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:23.140
Yes, sir!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:47.040
The Professor will be returning to base soon.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:48.900
Along with those two.

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:50.840
FuRyu and RaiRyu, huh?

00:08:51.080 --> 00:08:52.980
Two good comrades to have on our side, right?

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.010
Yes.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.380
Chief?

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:56.250
Hm?

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:59.480
I've got the results of the research you requested.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:00.850
Let me hear it.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:04.250
Right. Regarding the young boy named Ikumi Kaidou...

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:08.330
...just as we thought, he is not Mrs. Kaidou's biological son.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.860
Eight years ago, he was found near Mt. Aso in Kyushu...

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:18.930
...and was taken in as her adoptive son.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.340
Templum...

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:28.540
He has the same powers and his upbringing is similar to Mamoru's.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.440
Pizza... Soldato J...

00:09:32.290 --> 00:09:35.350
Was it this boy who restored him to his original form?

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:41.880
But why would they be working together?

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:49.500
What are they planning to do with the Zonder Crystals they're collecting?

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:53.300
As far as the crucial issues go, we're totally clueless.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.480
The same goes for the J-Ark. It's full of mysteries.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:58.670
Fusion!

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:05.180
J-Bird! Plug Out!

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:08.920
Mega-fusion!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:24.700
King J-Der!

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.100
5-Linked Maser Cannons!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.600
Antimeson Cannons!

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:38.110
And the source of that overwhelming power...

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.150
...is probably...

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:45.390
...an alien energy source, just like Galeon's.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:46.320
Right.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:50.550
To discover what it really is, we'll have to challenge them.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:51.600
Yeah.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:53.930
Ta-da!

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:57.130
Tonight we're having Tropical Burgers for dinner!

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.330
Oh, wow! That looks yummy!

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:03.040
Tonight I went the extra mile, you see!

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:06.080
Waha! You're the best, Mom!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.310
It's the code for Emergency Mobilization.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:19.690
Do you mind if I go out for a little while?

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:21.020
Mamoru...

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:30.530
If you're going to be late, don't forget to call us.

00:11:33.810 --> 00:11:34.470
Okay!

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.670
I'll see you later.

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:23.320
To Gai

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:29.820
Hey! Mikoto!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.460
Mikoto, did you see...

00:12:32.570 --> 00:12:34.230
What's the matter with you, barging in like that?

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:37.330
Did somebody come into this room? Someone like a ghost...

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.560
Stop it! I can't stand monsters and ghosts!

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:46.510
Oh, hey, maybe I was just imagining things.

00:12:46.580 --> 00:12:47.550
Really, now!

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:53.710
Would you mind knocking at least?

00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:54.720
Oh!

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:56.690
Sorry.

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:08.930
It's hard to believe, isn't it?

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.070
What is?

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:14.970
It's just that we're fighting to save the planet, you know.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:17.710
But we were high school kids a little while ago.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.810
That's true.

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:24.140
The thing is, I'm not really sure yet.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.480
Whether or not I'm helping you the way I should.

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:30.150
Don't talk like that!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:32.990
Who do you think I rely on to transform into GaoGaiGar?

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:34.990
Program Drive!

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:39.660
Final Fusion!

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:46.270
It's because of you that I can achieve Final Fusion, Mikoto.

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:53.140
GaoGaiGar!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.610
Of course, that's not all.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:04.920
Goldion Hammer... Safety Device... Relieve!

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.930
Hammer Connect!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.600
Goldion Hammer!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:25.070
The reason I was able to defeat EI-01...

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:28.070
The reason I can go on fighting the 21 Machine Primevals...

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:31.880
It's all thanks to you, Mikoto!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:35.890
Thank you, Gai.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.290
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:40.850
After all, I dragged you into this battle.

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:42.220
No...

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:45.160
I don't regret a thing!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:15:01.170
Special Agent Mamoru Amami has arrived at Gate No. 7.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:05.880
All staff members are to report to the 2nd Order Room.

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:08.520
Hey! Here they are!

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:10.550
Sorry we're late!

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:12.590
You're late, Big Brother Gai!

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:13.850
Sorry about that.

00:15:14.090 --> 00:15:16.260
Now then, shall we begin?

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:27.660
The 31 Machine Primevals destroyed the Bay Tower Base...

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:30.570
...and attempted to annihilate GaoGaiGar.

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:48.250
And then they launched an attack on this Orbit Base.

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.730
In other words, those monsters really have it in for us, huh?

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:01.500
It's true, they do seem determined to get rid of us.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.610
However...

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.310
It looks like the Primevals' true objective is something else entirely.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:15.090
ZX-04, which appeared in the Arctic Ocean...

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:17.120
...tried to eliminate the Van Allen Belt...

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:21.120
...and send mankind into extinction.

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.290
Furthermore, in the battle with ZX-05, we learned that...

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:30.930
...the Primevals possess the same powers as a Zonder plant.

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:39.610
Meaning they have the ability to transform all of mankind into Zonders?

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.510
I can't think of a more appropriate name for them than "Primeval"!

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:44.840
In order to prevent them from carrying out their objective...

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:47.850
...we need to find them while they're still in core form.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:50.120
Ah, so that's why you summoned Mamoru?

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:51.320
Huh?

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.460
In the past, this black box reacted to Gai's G-Stone...

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:02.370
...and provided us with a significant amount of information.

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:06.370
But with Mamoru's help, we might gain even more knowledge...

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:12.510
...about King J-Der's true identity and the way to detect Primeval cores.

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:14.310
But...

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.580
I...

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:20.520
Swan?

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:21.550
Yes, sir!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.160
But this is a G-Stone!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.130
It's a special G-Stone.

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:35.060
It's clearly comprised of different material than the other G-Stones.

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:38.500
But where was it until now?

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.670
Uh, it was stored in a certain place, and it's just come into our hands.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.370
Most likely...

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.350
...this is something that was meant to be worn around your neck.

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:00.580
I'm going to give it a try, then!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.390
Mamoru has just entered Purification Mode.

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:06.930
Prepare for analysis.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.270
Galeon...

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.270
Th-There it is!

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:28.880
Waha!

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:29.880
All right...

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.890
This is the 2nd Order Room.

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.380
We now have the results of our analysis.

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:35.160
And?

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:36.200
Well...

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:41.900
I'm sorry to report it's the exact same information we received before.

00:18:43.500 --> 00:18:44.800
I'm sorry.

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:46.570
There's no need to apologize.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.610
This is just... you see...

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.300
...it's just an experiment, after all.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:52.040
He's right, Mamoru.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.640
It's not as though we can win just because we have certain information.

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:59.380
All of us working together as a team is the most important thing.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.780
We've got FuRyu and RaiRyu on our team now, too.

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:05.650
Whoa, you're forgetting something important!

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:09.230
The brand-new Disc X is all set to go now!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:12.360
So once the repairs on the Mic models are done...

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:14.130
...we'll have absolutely nothing to fear!

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:17.300
So you see, Mamoru, there's no reason for you to feel down!

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:19.200
I guess you're right.

00:19:23.940 --> 00:19:25.100
Around this time...

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:29.670
...a satellite rocket was launched from the Republic of Kazakhstan.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.180
However...

00:19:35.390 --> 00:19:39.350
...little did anyone know that a Primeval Core had...

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.930
...attached itself to this very rocket.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:49.500
I can't seem to sense the Primevals, or Purify them, either.

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:52.200
Galeon...

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.440
If you know something, please tell me.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:59.880
The Machine of Destruction built by Cain!

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:01.850
Cain?

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:04.880
Machine of Destruction?

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:09.950
Galeon!

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:13.860
Curse you, Legacy of Cain!

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:16.290
Who is this Cain?

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:19.500
Is it really okay for me to stay on at GGG?

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.160
Galeon...

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:25.260
Why are you always protecting me?

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.270
Galeon!

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:35.150
The time is near...

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:41.080
My name is Cain.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.720
Cain? Where? Where are you?

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:47.190
The time is near...

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:51.460
The time is drawing near...

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:03.200
The time is drawing near...

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:28.930
I...

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:30.600
I...

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:34.140
It's a Primeval!

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:42.810
Target of attack...

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:44.640
Earth!

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:48.380
What?

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:50.780
Over 16,000?

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:55.660
But what could possibly transform so suddenly?

00:21:55.860 --> 00:21:56.920
Is it a Primeval?

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:02.930
All of you, stand by for Level One Combat Mode!

00:22:22.660 --> 00:22:23.350
What's that?

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:27.150
It's an asteroid cluster! It's coming through an ES Window!

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:29.330
No! There's so many of them!

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.500
Based on orbital calculations, all of them will be landing on Earth!

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:35.530
If that many asteroids hit Earth...

00:22:39.010 --> 00:22:41.500
Mankind will be wiped out!

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.100 --> 00:23:47.940
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.340 --> 00:23:51.040
Stop the unlimited barrage of falling asteroids!

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:52.480
Mic Brigade, mobilize!

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:53.770
Susanoh, launch!

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:55.580
Reflector Beam, open!

00:23:55.850 --> 00:23:59.380
ChoRyuJin, GekiRyuJin, use your SP Packs to go on the attack!

00:23:59.450 --> 00:24:03.120
Go forward, GaoGaiGar! Defeat the Primevals with your space gear!

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:05.120
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.190 --> 00:24:06.720
"Showdown in the Darkness"

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:06.290
Showdown in the Darkness

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:10.020
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:14.940
Climber 1

00:24:12.800 --> 00:24:14.430
This is the Key to Victory!
